 "text": "This is for the people who always end up on the couch because somebody will not stop snoring. You've tried nudging them, earplugs, even mouth tape that leaves a circle on your face. This is Mute. It's a tiny clear dilator that sits just inside the nose and gently opens it. In their trial, seventy-five percent of users said they snored less. The starter pack comes with all three sizes, so you find the one that fits, and each one lasts up to ten nights. Honestly, the worst part is losing your excuse to kick them at two AM. Holiday trips mean shared rooms, so grab one for you and one for your dad. It's in the orange cart.",
